Company Description:
Peinado Construction is a premier Design-Build General Contractor specializing in Industrial, Manufacturing, Distribution Centers, Data Centers, Medical and Office. With operations in Dallas/Fort Worth, Austin/San Antonio and El Paso, Peinado Construction is responsible for delivering approximately 60,000,000 SF of Tilt Wall facilities in Texas.

Our team excels as a specialty service provider, fulfilling the unique requirements of the Developer and Real Estate Tenants. The extensive team experience of the key associates combines backgrounds representing the commercial general contractor, industrial and office developer and design-build provider. Our goal is to deliver client-focused services, adding value and accelerating project timelines without compromising on quality or safety.

Peinado Construction is a certified:
Minority Business Enterprise (MBE/WBE) by the North Central Texas Regional Certification Agency (NCTRCA); 
South Central Texas Regional Certified (SCTRCA) *HABE & MBE; 
Minority Business Enterprise by the National Minority Supplier Development Council, Inc. (NMSDC) and the Dallas/Fort Worth Minority Supplier Development Council; 
Historically Underutilized Business Program (HUB).

